OL,3,GNEWSAIOD urges tax reform decision at
OL,4,AStates meeting
OL,5,
OL,6,FBusiness organisations are calling for
OL,7,Fthe States of Guernsey to make a
OL,8,Fdecision on reforms to the island's tax
OL,9,Fsystem.
OL,11,FIn a letter to deputies seen by the
OL,12,FBBC, the Institute of Directors (IOD)
OL,13,Fhas called on politicians to make a
OL,14,Fdecision at the States meeting starting
OL,15,Fon Wednesday, and back Policy and
OL,16,FResources' tax package proposal.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
