OL,3,GNEWSAIOD urges tax reform decision at
OL,4,AStates meeting
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Guernsey Retail Group has warned a
OL,7,Fgoods and services tax (GST) will
OL,8,Fdamage local businesses, while the
OL,9,FChamber of Commerce has stressed the
OL,10,Fneed for both tax reform and spending
OL,11,Frestraint.
OL,13,FA petition against P&R's tax package
OL,14,Fwith more than 9,000 signatures is set
OL,15,Fto be handed to deputies this morning.
